-- The two defined terms.
#ASSERT count `s 3(1)(a) the terms the Act defines` EQUALS 2
GIVEN word IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`where the Act defines` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 3(1)(a) the Act's definition of` word
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST t THEN JUST (t's `where defined`)
#ASSERT `where the Act defines` "the claimant" EQUALS JUST "s 3(1)(a)"
#ASSERT `where the Act defines` "the defendant" EQUALS JUST "s 3(1)(a)"
