#ASSERT `s 3(1) the court may require the defendant to transfer property to the claimant` (`a restitution case on` (`the standard contract made on` `15 June 1990` NOTHING) TRUE) `property acquired under the contract` `the claimant` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

