`a restitution case the court may act on` MEANS `a restitution case on` (`the standard contract made on` `1 March 2020` NOTHING) TRUE
`a restitution case the court may not act on` MEANS `a restitution case on` (`the standard contract made on` `1 March 2020` NOTHING) FALSE

