§ `Tests -- the dates at the four sites (FORK F2)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- The same day gets the same answer at s 1, s 2(a), s 3(1)(a) and the s 4 bar: outside a date the text fixes in its own words the
-- answer is JUST FALSE (a limb that is not met is FALSE).  The day before, the day itself and the day after 9 April 1987; the day
-- before, the day itself and the day after 12 November 1993.  Inside the window the exception (section 5 of the Civil Law Act 1909) decides.

-- 8 April 1987 and 9 April 1987: outside, at all four sites (the s 4 gate does not speak either).
